## Scalar, physical accuracy and resource ledger

For the calibrated displacement x, the nominal scalar action is
alpha0=13027/240, and the exact whole-word scalar action is

    alpha_total=Mn alpha0+(8M/15)sum_(selected j) x_j.        (11)

The full endpoint contains exp(-i alpha_total); no scalar is discarded or
corrected for free. The final comparator includes det W and the old scalar
from exp(-iTK). All pulse coefficients, old terms and positive reserves
remain literal. Controls still have common added incident cap 2E0 and slew
16E0^2/hbar, with zero controls/derivatives at joins. The word has 24Mn
pulses and duration T_lab; it is not physically short because its encoding
is short. Its absolute modeled control variation is <=72Mn E0.

If the actual generator has integrated full-norm defect eta_drive over this
actual duration, Duhamel adds eta_drive to epsilon. Uniform amplitude error
delta_a on all 24Mn pulses costs <=c(24Mn)delta_a. Identity faults count.
Clock, waveform and old-drift faults need their actual integrated bound;
an endpoint-time mismatch adds the corresponding old-evolution error.
The exact 128-bit displacement representation is not a claim that physical
128-bit calibration over the enormous total duration suffices. For example,
T<2^220 and c<2 make delta_a<=2^-300 sufficient for an amplitude-only
contribution <2^-79, but no device supplying that accuracy is provided.

The operator comparator extends to arbitrary unknown old/reference inputs,
with joint trace error <=2(epsilon+eta_drive), plus any initial trace error.
There are no added quantum registers; external controller outputs are
unmodeled, not silently restored. At zero-control endpoints the actual work
is Tr K(rho_f-rho_i). Both initial/final trace errors cost
width(K)(delta_i+delta_f)/2. This chosen W commutes with K, so its ideal
actual-time comparator has zero net work for every input, despite entangling
and mixing computational states. The enormous absolute work-variation
allowance remains; zero net work is not zero apparatus cost. Residual
endpoint controls require their own expectation terms. Nothing here supplies
autonomous timing, microscopic drive bookkeeping, halt or infinite reuse.

